{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","福尔摩斯"],["/names/en","Sherlock Holmes"],["/description_i18n/cn","一位优秀的名侦探，能够通过推理提前反制敌人。"],["/description_i18n/en","A brilliant detective who deduces his enemies' next moves and counters them before they can act."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","新的案件？"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/en","A new case?"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","离真相又近了一步。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/en","One step closer to the truth."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","好戏开场。"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/en","The game is afoot."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","再梳理一次线索吧……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/en","Let's go over the clues again..."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","结案。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/en","Case closed."],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","排除所有不可能后，剩下的即为真相。"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/en","When you rule out all the wrong answers, the truth emerges."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","感情是理智的敌人。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/en","Emotion often clouds logical judgment."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","我属于工作，不属于享乐。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/en","All play and no work gets nothing done."],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","完全正确的答案。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","An astute choice."],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","有用的数据。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","This gives me valuable information."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","最近有什么案子吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Are there any cases worthy of my intellect lately?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","这个世界的巫术真是不可思议"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","The magic of this world is quite extraordinary."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","要是有我熟悉的酒就更好了"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","I should prefer a vintage far more agreeable to my palate."],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","一位亡灵女士，一尊雕像，一只蝙蝠。看来你就是这个世界上最伟大的魔法师——梅林——的导师了。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","A Graveborn lady, a stone golem, and a bat. I assume that makes you the mentor of the world's greatest mage, Merlin."],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415808.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415808.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","福尔摩斯 & 佐尔娅"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Sherlock Holmes & Zorya"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","最近有什么案子吗？"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","Are there any cases worthy of my intellect lately?"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415829.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415829.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","福尔摩斯"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Sherlock Holmes"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","要是有我熟悉的酒就更好了"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","I should prefer a vintage far more agreeable to my palate."],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415830.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415830.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","福尔摩斯"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Sherlock Holmes"]]}